# 2-tier FatTree, 128 nodes, 400 Gbps
# Paper-faithful: Downlink_Latency_ns 500 (0.5 us/hop) matching REPS paper arXiv:2407.21625 sec 4.1
Nodes 128
Tiers 2
Podsize 128

Tier 0
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 0

Tier 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 400
Radix_Down 16
Downlink_Latency_ns 500
Switch_Latency_ns 0
